# Lumberjack 20
tags: heroes, benchmark
stimulus: Seven twenty-rep movements, each followed by a 400 m run.
note: The dumbbell squat cleans are done with two dumbbells. The original posting gives men's loads only, except for the overhead squat and the box; the other women's loads are the commonly used ones.
For time
  20 Deadlift 275/185 lb
  400 m Run
  20 Kettlebell swing 2/1.5 pood
  400 m Run
  20 Overhead squat 115/75 lb
  400 m Run
  20 Burpee
  400 m Run
  20 Chest-to-bar pull-up
  400 m Run
  20 Box jump 24/20 in
  400 m Run
  20 Dumbbell squat clean 45/35 lb
  400 m Run
